    "attribution_note": "Viral-loop recipients are 47% of the activated users at sales-ready accounts but get first-touch credit for only 7% of those accounts. First-touch attribution undervalues expansion loops by design, so loops are measured separately, on the prospects they push over the sales trigger.",
